00:01:57.483 --> 00:02:12.485
Malis and her class go on a nature walk. They follow a trail into the woods. Malis touches the rough bark of a tree and finds a pinecone. Green moss grows on an old tree stump. They see a footprint in the mud and pick up acorns and twigs.

